sequenceDiagram
  actor U as You (Telegram)
  participant Bot as Orchestrator bot
  participant V as voice-stt / voice-tts
  participant Sub as Background subagent
  participant Lead as project-lead
  participant Ext as X / LinkedIn / Medium

  U->>Bot: DM (text or voice memo)
  opt voice memo
    Bot->>V: transcribe (whisper)
    V-->>Bot: text
  end
  Note over Bot: Quick task -> answer inline.<br/>Slow/long task -> dispatch + ack now<br/>(channel never blocks).
  Bot-->>U: "On it - I'll message you when it's done."
  Bot->>Sub: dispatch (run_in_background)
  alt spawn / message a project-lead
    Sub->>Lead: spawn (systemd-run + tmux) or send-keys
    Lead-->>Sub: reply (scraped from pane)
  else post to a platform
    Sub->>Ext: playwright (shared auth)
  end
  Sub-->>Bot: result (task notification)
  opt voice reply
    Bot->>V: synthesize (piper)
    V-->>Bot: opus audio
  end
  Bot-->>U: reply (text or voice)
